14	// COVER-OBJECTS-001: a station the host's catalogue offers is a goal in its own right. The chain serves
15	// one ambition at a time, and on an account that owns a ship that ambition is its next war hull, so the
16	// station nobody else waits on was skipped as "producible" and the facilities only it wants were never
17	// asked for -- the host names no other object that wants a level-ten robotics factory, so the whole climb
18	// to the nano factory (and the terraformer behind it) stayed unreachable. Each story below plants the
19	// account at one side of that boundary and reads what it queues.
